      {
        "author_name": "Sam A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108728194356089157577/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIxB46cnaLrhs0bJDN98oQ7eLiW2WwLgn_EJoCEGMIfYSKnFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Gym is good for teens who either sneek in without paying because it's very easy to come it unnoticed at the entrance, or they take a machine and sit on it and hang around it and chat for like 30 mins so no one else can use it.\nPlace is good if you want to come do some light work out on a few machines, if available, then leave.",
        "time": 1761402073,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vivek",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108222758139225954635/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrcvS06yHvsgvRVKVvMJ0FxghPong5wlER657ZnpUKds1JpdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Nice gym , Not much crowd but lacks many machines and moreover people grab a machine and keep on sitting for 20-30 mins. There should be atleast sets of 2 machines. Only 1 Squat rack, one for Back pull downs. Need more Machines and Racks for sure",
        "time": 1753927731,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alyssa Leblanc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107856965441301441743/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKa9caKsuMxElneF7pRLEfHEjC55yGzHuV0gi5cOZo2AJeuiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "This gym is by far the best one. I’ve tried week trials on a few gyms to see if I wanted a change. But this gym is perfect compared to others. The staff is always smiling and greeting you, and on most machines there’s always 2 which is great if someone is using it.",
        "time": 1743552687,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brittany Young",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103461978050717791356/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJcJRJ4DU7H_-l-7ezN9nwkhWFi4Q7P7kJXnF8m3Wvwhr7iOQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Wonderful workers!!! Amazing service it’s like everytime i walk in here it’s like Disney world. Shoutout to Luca HES THE BEST!!!!",
        "time": 1762389734,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nick Yasa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110983220621172698419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJNu1TGKO6tJYjF1yDx2K5FJZf9j7014_sABfXjbrnM7tM5mg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Been going here consistently for a year.\nThe staff is AWESOME. (Seriously 11/10)\nThe gym can get a little busy between 5pm-9pm, but honestly the only gym you'll find that isn't busy at those hours, is home gyms.\nNot sure what that one negative review about equipment being broken all the time is about. Stuff breaks sometimes but the staff at Econo Pincourt is always on top of it.\nAlso, the gym members are an amazing community, I'm proud to be a part of it.\nChanged my life. Amazing gym with great people all around.",
        "time": 1741279149,
        "translated": false
      }
